very", "start": 37.8, "end": 38.088}, {"text": "fast", "start": 38.088, "end": 38.475}, {"text": "website", "start": 38.475, "end": 38.95}, {"text": "you've", "start": 38.95, "end": 39.1}, {"text": "ever", "start": 39.1, "end": 39.35}, {"text": "used", "start": 39.35, "end": 39.6}, {"text": "lean", "start": 39.6, "end": 39.812}, {"text": "on", "start": 39.812, "end": 39.913}, {"text": "this", "start": 39.913, "end": 40.075}, {"text": "trick", "start": 40.075, "end": 40.825}]}, {"index": 4, "kind": "prose", "text": "Picture a popular restaurant chain. The flagship kitchen in one city makes an incredible sauce — but shipping every serving across the country would be slow and expensive. So the chain opens regional kitchens that keep the sauce ready to go. Diners everywhere get the same dish, fast. A CDN is a network of regional kitchens for your bytes: hundreds of edge locations (Points of Presence, or PoPs) that cache your content near your users.", "start": 41.125, "end": 66.2, "words": [{"text": "Picture", "start": 41.375, "end": 41.7}, {"text": "a", "start": 41.7, "end": 41.775}, {"text": "popular", "start": 41.775, "end": 42.2}, {"text": "restaurant", "start": 42.2, "end": 42.688}, {"text": "chain", "start": 42.688, "end": 43.475}, {"text": "The", "start": 43.475, "end": 43.675}, {"text": "flagship", "start": 43.675, "end": 44.1}, {"text": "kitchen", "start": 44.1, "end": 44.413}, {"text": "in", "start": 44.413, "end": 44.5}, {"text": "one", "start": 44.5, "end": 44.725}, {"text": "city", "start": 44.725, "end": 45.0}, {"text": "makes", "start": 45.0, "end": 45.237}, {"text": "an", "start": 45.237, "end": 45.312}, {"text": "incredible", "start": 45.312, "end": 45.862}, {"text": "sauce", "start": 45.862, "end": 46.4}, {"text": "but", "start": 46.4, "end": 46.612}, {"text": "shipping", "start": 46.612, "end": 46.95}, {"text": "every", "start": 46.95, "end": 47.237}, {"text": "serving", "start": 47.237, "end": 47.612}, {"text": "across", "start": 47.612, "end": 47.91