dge", "start": 60.425, "end": 60.65}, {"text": "locations", "start": 60.65, "end": 61.45}, {"text": "Points", "start": 61.45, "end": 61.812}, {"text": "of", "start": 61.812, "end": 61.9}, {"text": "Presence", "start": 61.9, "end": 62.425}, {"text": "or", "start": 62.425, "end": 62.625}, {"text": "PoPs", "start": 62.625, "end": 63.5}, {"text": "that", "start": 63.5, "end": 63.725}, {"text": "cache", "start": 63.725, "end": 64.013}, {"text": "your", "start": 64.013, "end": 64.125}, {"text": "content", "start": 64.125, "end": 64.6}, {"text": "near", "start": 64.6, "end": 64.775}, {"text": "your", "start": 64.775, "end": 64.95}, {"text": "users", "start": 64.95, "end": 65.925}]}, {"index": 5, "kind": "prose", "text": "The request path", "start": 66.2, "end": 68.0, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 66.425, "end": 66.5}, {"text": "request", "start": 66.5, "end": 66.95}, {"text": "path", "start": 66.95, "end": 67.575}]}, {"index": 6, "kind": "prose", "text": "The first user in a region pays the full round trip; everyone after them gets the cached copy. The metric that runs the whole business is the cache hit ratio: the fraction of requests served from the edge without touching your origin. Static assets (images, video, JS bundles) routinely hit 95 percent+; personalized API responses might be near 0 percent.", "start": 68.0, "end": 90.05, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 68.25, "end": 68.325}, {"text": "first", "start": 68.325, "end": 68.625}, {"text": "user", "start": 68.625, "end": 68.888}, {"text": "in", "start": 68.888, "end": 68.963}, {"text": "a", "start": 68.963, "end": 69.025}, {"text": "region", "start": 69.025, "end": 69.425}, {"text": "pays", "start": 69.425, "end": 69.713}, {"text": "the", "start": 69.713, "end": 69.812}, {"text": "full", "start": 69.812, "end": 70.05}, {"text": "round", "start": 70.05, "end": 70.325}, {"text": "trip", "start": 70.325, "end": 70.9}, {"text": "everyone", "start": 70.9, "end": 71.4}, {"text": "after", "start": 71.4, "end": 71.