": "and", "start": 219.85, "end": 220.037}, {"text": "what", "start": 220.037, "end": 220.175}, {"text": "most", "start": 220.175, "end": 220.4}, {"text": "sites", "start": 220.4, "end": 220.75}, {"text": "use", "start": 220.75, "end": 221.7}, {"text": "In", "start": 221.7, "end": 222.0}, {"text": "push", "start": 222.0, "end": 222.4}, {"text": "you", "start": 222.4, "end": 222.562}, {"text": "upload", "start": 222.562, "end": 222.925}, {"text": "content", "start": 222.925, "end": 223.375}, {"text": "to", "start": 223.375, "end": 223.463}, {"text": "the", "start": 223.463, "end": 223.55}, {"text": "CDN's", "start": 223.55, "end": 224.1}, {"text": "storage", "start": 224.1, "end": 224.525}, {"text": "directly", "start": 224.525, "end": 225.037}, {"text": "better", "start": 225.037, "end": 225.425}, {"text": "for", "start": 225.425, "end": 225.55}, {"text": "huge", "start": 225.55, "end": 225.825}, {"text": "files", "start": 225.825, "end": 226.237}, {"text": "video", "start": 226.237, "end": 226.575}, {"text": "libraries", "start": 226.575, "end": 227.5}, {"text": "where", "start": 227.5, "end": 227.775}, {"text": "you", "start": 227.775, "end": 227.887}, {"text": "don't", "start": 227.887, "end": 228.1}, {"text": "want", "start": 228.1, "end": 228.325}, {"text": "origins", "start": 228.325, "end": 228.825}, {"text": "involved", "start": 228.825, "end": 229.875}]}, {"index": 22, "kind": "prose", "text": "Anycast routing: your domain resolves to one IP advertised from every PoP; BGP routing sends each user to the nearest one. This is why one DNS answer serves the planet.", "start": 230.175, "end": 242.55, "words": [{"text": "Anycast", "start": 230.45, "end": 230.975}, {"text": "routing", "start": 230.975, "end": 231.8}, {"text": "your", "start": 231.8, "end": 232.075}, {"text": "domain", "start": 232.075, "end": 232.5}, {"text": "resolves", "start": 232.5, "end": 232.975}, {"text": "to", "start": 232.975, "end": 233.1}, {"text": "one", "start": 233.1, "end": 233.325}, {"text": "IP", "start": 233.325, "end": 233.75}, {"text": "advertised", "start": 233.75, "end": 234.375}, {"text": "from", "start": 234.375, "end": 234.525}, {"text": "every", "start": 234.525, "end": 234.8}, {"text": "PoP", "start": 234.8, "end": 235.675}, {"text": "BGP", "start": 235.675, "end": 236.35}, {"text": "routing", "start": 236.35, "end": 236.775}, {"text": "sends", "start": 236.775, "end": 237.125}, {"text": "each", "start": 237.125, "end": 237.375}, {"text": "user", "start": 237.375, "end": 237.675}, {"text": "to", "start": 237.675, "end": 237.763}, {"text": "the", "start": 237.763, "end": 237.85}, {"text": "nearest", "start": 237.85, "end": 238.25}, {"text": "one", "start": 238.25, "end": 239.05}, {"text": "This", "start": 239.05, "end": 239.475}, {"text": "is", "start": 239.475, "end": 239.625}, {"text": "why", "start": 239.625, "end": 239.825}, {"text": "one", "start": 239.825, "end": 240.05}, {"text": "DNS", "start": 240.05, "end": 240.5}, {"text": "answer", "start": 240.5, "end": 240.913}, {"text": "serves", "start": 240.913, "end": 241.263}, {"text": "the", "start": 241.263, "end": 241.35}, {"text": "planet", "start": 241.35, "end": 242.25}]}, {"index": 23, "kind": "prose", "text": "Cost model: you pay mostly for egress bandwidth and requests. A misconfigured cache (low hit ratio) doesn't just hurt latency — it shows up on the invoice, twice.", "start": 242.55, "end": 252.9, "words": [{"text": "Cost", "start": 242.8, "end": 243.075}, {"text": "model", "start": 243.075, "end": 243.375}, {"text": "you", "start": 243.375, "end": 243.55}, {"text": "pay", "start": 243.55, "end": 243.775}, {"text": "mostly", "start": 243.775, "end": 244.175}, {"text": "for", "start": 244.175, "end": 244.3}, {"text": "egress", "start": 244.3, "end": 244.675}, {"text": "bandwidth", "start": 244.675, "end": 245.188}, {"text": "and", "start": 245.188, "end": 245.288}, {"text": "requests", "start": 245.288, "end": 246.35}, {"text": "A", "start": 246.35, "end": 246.575}, {"text": "misconfigured", "start": 246.575, "end": 247.225}, {"text": "cache", "start": 247.225, "end": 247.65}, {"text": "low", "start": 247.65, "end": 247.925}, {"text": "hit", "start": 247.925, "end": 248.125}, {"text": "ratio", "start": 248.125, "end": 248.9}, {"text": "doesn't", "start": 248.9, "end": 249.275}, {"text": "just", "start": 249.275, "end": 249.475}, {"text": "hurt", "start": 249.475, "end": 249.725}, {"text": "latency", "start": 249.725, "end": 250.375}, {"text": "it", "start": 250.375, "end": 250.613}, {"text": "shows", "start": 250.613, "end": 250.888}, {"text": "up", "start": 250.888, "end": 251.038}, {"text": "on", "start": 251.038, "end": 251.138}, {"text": "the", "start": 251.138, "end": 251.225}, {"text": "invoice", "start": 251.225, "end": 251.625}, {"text": "twice", "start": 251.625, "end": 252.6}]}, {"index": 24, "kind": "prose", "text": "Takeaways", "start": 252.9, "end": 254.4, "words": [{"text": "Takeaways", "start": 253.15, "end": 254.1}]}, {"index": 25, "kind": "prose", "text": "CDNs beat the speed of light by moving content to edge PoPs near users; the cache hit ratio is the metric that matters.", "start": 254.4, "end": 262.925, "words": [{"text": "CDNs", "start": 254.7, "end": 255.388}, {"text": "beat", "start": 255.388, "end": 255.613}, {"text": "the", "start": 255.613, "end": 255.7}, {"text": "speed", "start": 255.7, "end": 255.988}, {"text": "of", "start": 255.988, "end": 256.075}, {"text": "light", "start": 256.075, "end": 256.45}, {"text": "by", "start": 256.45, "end": 256.625}, {"text": "moving", "start": 256.625, "end": 256.925}, {"text": "content", "start": 256.925, "end": 257.4}, {"text": "to", "start": 257.4, "end": 257.525}, {"text": "edge", "start": 257.525, "end": 257.75}, {"text": "PoPs", "start": 257.75, "end": 258.5}, {"text": "near", "start": 258.5, "end": 258.725}, {"text": "users", "start": 258.725, "end": 259.65}, {"text": "the", "start": 259.65, "end": 259.85}, {"text": "cache", "start": 259.85, "end": 260.15}, {"text": "hit", "start": 260.15, "end": 260.35}, {"text": "ratio", "start": 260.35, "end": 260.875}, {"text": "is", "start": 260.875, "end": 261.025}, {"text": "the", "start": 261.025, "end": 261.125}, {"text": "metric", "start": 261.125, "end": 261.525}, {"text": "that", "start": 261.525, "end": 261.675}, {"text": "matters", "start": 261.675, "end": 262.65}]}, {"index": 26, "kind": "prose", "text": "Layer the caches — edge, regional, origin shield — so misses don't stampede your origin.", "start": 262.925, "end": 268.85, "words": [{"text": "Layer", "start": 263.2, "end": 263.413}, {"text": "the", "start": 263.413, "end": 263.5}, {"text": "caches", "start": 263.5, "end": 264.05}, {"text": "edge", "start": 264.05, "end": 264.4}, {"text": "regional", "start": 264.4, "end": 264.9}, {"text": "origin", "start": 264.9, "end": 265.387}, {"text": "shield", "start": 265.387, "end": 266.088}, {"text": "so", "start": 266.088, "end": 266.35}, {"text": "misses", "start": 266.35, "end": 266.675}, {"text": "don't", "start": 266.675, "end": 266.95}, {"text": "stampede", "start": 266.95, "end": 267.488}, {"text": "your", "start": 267.488, "end": 267.6}, {"text": "origin", "start": 267.6, "end": 268.575}]}, {"index": 27, "kind": "prose", "text": "Version static assets immutably instead of purging; purge is slower and scarier than it looks.", "start": 268.85, "end": 275.0, "words": [{"text": "Version", "start": 269.125, "end": 269.55}, {"text": "static", "start": 269.55, "end": 269.925}, {"text": "assets", "start": 269.925, "end": 270.35}, {"text": "immutably", "start": 270.35, "end": 270.875}, {"text": "instead", "start": 270.875, "end": 271.188}, {"text": "of", "start": 271.188, "end": 271.275}, {"text": "purging", "start": 271.275, "end": 272.1}, {"text": "purge", "start": 272.1, "end": 272.538}, {"text": "is", "start": 272.538, "end": 272.663}, {"text": "slower", "start": 272.663, "end": 273.05}, {"text": "and", "start": 273.05, "end": 273.175}, {"text": "scarier", "start": 273.175,